called Loren for a Twitter app he built,

165
00:04:41,270 --> 00:04:41,960
called Tweetie,

166
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:42,800
around 2008.

167
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:43,880
And

168
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:45,840
he himself later said that this thing is

169
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:46,900
really addictive,

170
00:04:46,900 --> 00:04:48,680
right? So it's an addictive feature,

171
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:50,180
an addictive gesture,

172
00:04:50,180 --> 00:04:51,360
and it has this

173
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,020
unpredictable

174
00:04:52,020 --> 00:04:53,380
reward again at the end of it.

175
00:04:53,380 --> 00:04:55,200
When you pull down your feed to refresh,

176
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:56,440
you don't know what's coming,

177
00:04:56,440 --> 00:04:57,940
but you know something new will pop up,

