00:04:57,940 --> 00:04:58,570
right?

179
00:04:58,570 --> 00:04:59,860
So you keep pulling down.

180
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:01,840
Another intentional design that keeps you

181
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:04,680
stuck on your phone is the infinite scroll.

182
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:06,320
If you don't know what the infinite scroll is,

183
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:08,420
it's just the ability to keep scrolling

184
00:05:08,420 --> 00:05:10,640
infinitely. Before this feature or this design

185
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:11,820
was made,

186
00:05:11,820 --> 00:05:13,460
websites used to have pages.

187
00:05:13,460 --> 00:05:15,040
When you get to the bottom and you wanted

188
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,320
to see more content,

189
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:18,220
you would have to click next page.

190
00:05:18,220 --> 00:05:20,420
That click was a stopping point.

191
00:05:20,420 --> 00:05:23,010
It's a very important moment where your brain

192
00:05:23,010 --> 00:05:24,500
