205
00:05:46,940 --> 00:05:47,940
do I want to load more or do I

206
00:05:47,940 --> 00:05:49,220
want to drop my freaking phone?

207
00:05:49,220 --> 00:05:50,780
But that is no longer there.

208
00:05:50,780 --> 00:05:53,761
If you notice older forms of media had

209
00:05:53,761 --> 00:05:54,900
stopping cues.

