For example,

211
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:56,720
a book has chapters.

212
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:58,420
I do this when I read book where I

213
00:05:58,420 --> 00:05:59,840
try to get to the end of one chapter

214
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:00,920
so that I can drop the book and maybe

215
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:01,830
get to something.

216
00:06:01,830 --> 00:06:02,920
So a book has chapters,

217
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:04,170
that's a stopping cue.

218
00:06:04,170 --> 00:06:04,900
A TV show,

219
00:06:04,900 --> 00:06:07,240
TV shows used to end and then you'd have

220
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:08,160
to wait

